quipu\-fork\-diff \- Diff two forks
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu fork diff\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIa\fR> <\fIb\fR> 
